      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SURPRISED (8) shapes well for this backing up a dynamic 24.15 win with success at this track over 460m last time, recording 26.02. Rates a top chance again if runs up to recent form. ASTON BUGSY (5) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.2 lengths second (26.29) behind DR. WARREN at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Expected to be in this for a long way. HERE COMES BILLY (3) jumped well to win over the 425m at Traralgon two runs back then settled forward again when finishing third at this track last start. Must be included in calculations. ELIJAH ROSE (1) missed the frame latest (26.28) when fourth over 460m at this track in a Grade 5 H. Has already won out of this draw.",
